Parry
Parry increases the chance to completely mitigate a Physical attack. A successful Parry nullifies the attack dealt, and also reduces the swing timer of the defender's next attack.
Only Hunters, Paladins, Rogues and Warriors can Parry attacks. Enhancement Shaman have a talent that also allows them to Parry attacks.
One point of Defense increases the chance to parry by 0.04%
When an attack is Parried, the defender swings its weapon 40% faster for its next attack.
You're only able to Parry an attack when facing your attacker.
Formula for chance to Parry:
5% base + parry rating + parry talents + ((Defense skill - enemy's weapon skill) * 0.04)
